    <bpmn:process id="W_W4921" name="W4921. New-Hire Uniform / Workwear Issuance &amp; Onboarding Kit" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New-hire onboarding (VS-121/VS-19.1); offer accepted
Frequency: Per hire (~1,200–1,600 hires/yr)
Volume: ~1,200–1,600 onboarding kits/yr × role-based kit quantity
Owner: HR Shared Services (VS-103) / Store Manager / Uniform Program Manager
Participants: HR (VS-19/VS-121), Store Ops (VS-07), Supplier (W4917), HRIS/ESS (VS-29/VS-103)
Source: workflow W4921 — New-Hire Uniform / Workwear Issuance &amp; Onboarding Kit</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4921_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4921_Lane1" name="HRSS">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4921_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4921_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4921_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4921_Lane2" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4921_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4921_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4921_Start4" name="New-hire onboarding (VS-121/VS-19.1); offer accepted">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4921_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4921_Task5" name="Generate the onboarding kit order from HRIS/ESS on offer-acceptance (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Generate the onboarding kit order from HRIS/ESS on offer-acceptance (links VS-121): apply the role-based standard (W4914) and sizing (W4918) to produce the kit list (e.g., 3 polo/tee, 2 trousers, 1 jacket, branded footwear, name tag, role-PPE per W4915), source from buffer stock (W4932) or supplier call-off (W4917)
Responsible (R): HRSS / ESS / Program Manager
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Per hire</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4921_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4921_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4921_Task6" name="Issue &amp; fit at onboarding (links VS-19.1): hand over the kit, verify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Issue &amp; fit at onboarding (links VS-19.1): hand over the kit, verify fit/comfort (W4918/W4933), capture issuance/asset record (VS-35/VS-29), brief on care/laundering (W4924) and the appearance/PPE policy, and trigger any PPE fit-test (W4922)
Responsible (R): Store Manager / HRSS / HSE
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per hire</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4921_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4921_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4921_Task7" name="Handle exceptions: size exchanges (W4926), delayed supplier delivery…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Handle exceptions: size exchanges (W4926), delayed supplier delivery (buffer-stock fallback W4932), interim/temporary uniform for day-1, and record any gap; feed onboarding-uniform lead-time to supplier SLA (W4931)
Responsible (R): HRSS / Supplier / Store Manager
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Per hire</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4921_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4921_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4921_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4921_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4921_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-738 (ensure controlled execution — Uniform, Workwear &amp; PPE Issuance, Laundering &amp; Lifecycle Operations (PA-169.2).) | - CTL-738: role-based kit per standard; sized/fit-verified; asset-recorded (VS-35); buffer-stock fallback
Owner: HR Shared Services (VS-103) / Store Manager / Uniform Program Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4921_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4921_Annotation9" targetRef="W4921_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4921_Flow11" sourceRef="W4921_Start4" targetRef="W4921_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4921_Flow12" sourceRef="W4921_Task5" targetRef="W4921_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4921_Flow13" sourceRef="W4921_Task6" targetRef="W4921_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4921_Flow14" sourceRef="W4921_Task7" targetRef="W4921_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
