    <bpmn:process id="W_W4922" name="W4922. Role-Based PPE Issuance, Fit-Testing &amp; Training" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New-hire (W4921); role/equipment change; PPE replacement (W4925); HSE review (VS-24)
Frequency: Per employee + per replacement
Volume: ~6,911 employees + contingent × role-PPE × replacement cycle
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Uniform Program Manager / Site Supervisor
Participants: HSE (VS-24), HR (VS-19), Store Ops (VS-07), DC Ops (VS-04), Occupational Health (VS-83), Supplier (W4917)
Source: workflow W4922 — Role-Based PPE Issuance, Fit-Testing &amp; Training</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4922_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4922_Lane1" name="HSE">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4922_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4922_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4922_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4922_Lane2" name="Site Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4922_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4922_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4922_Start4" name="New-hire (W4921); role/equipment change; PPE replacement (W4925); HSE review (VS-24)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4922_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4922_Task5" name="Issue role-PPE per the matrix (W4915): hand over certified PPE (hard hat…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Issue role-PPE per the matrix (W4915): hand over certified PPE (hard hat, safety shoes, hi-vis, eye/face, hearing, respiratory, gloves, harness as applicable), verify certification (VS-117), record issuance/asset (VS-35), and source from buffer stock (W4932)
Responsible (R): HSE / Site Supervisor / Supplier
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Per employee</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4922_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4922_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4922_Task6" name="Conduct fit-testing &amp; training (links VS-24/VS-19.4): respiratory fit-test…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Conduct fit-testing &amp; training (links VS-24/VS-19.4): respiratory fit-test, harness/helmet correct-fit verification, instruct on correct use/limitation/care/when-to-replace, and the DOLE-OSH obligation to use; record competency
Responsible (R): HSE / Occupational Health / Training
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Per employee</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4922_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4922_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4922_Task7" name="Enforce use &amp; audit compliance (links W4930): supervisors enforce PPE-use on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Enforce use &amp; audit compliance (links W4930): supervisors enforce PPE-use on the floor/yard/DC, the PPE-use exception (non-compliance) is a disciplinary/OSH matter (VS-84), and periodic compliance audits verify correct/worn/in-date PPE
Responsible (R): Site Supervisor / HSE / LP
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4922_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4922_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4922_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4922_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4922_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-738 (ensure controlled execution — Uniform, Workwear &amp; PPE Issuance, Laundering &amp; Lifecycle Operations (PA-169.2).) | - CTL-738: certified PPE per matrix (W4915); fit-tested &amp; trained; competency recorded; use enforced &amp; audited (W4930)
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Uniform Program Manager / Site Supervisor</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4922_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4922_Annotation9" targetRef="W4922_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
