    <bpmn:process id="W_W4923" name="W4923. Contingent / Outsourced &amp; Vendor-Personnel Uniform &amp; PPE Provision" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Contingent-worker engagement (VS-98); vendor/3PL site access (VS-56/VS-110); contract
Frequency: Per engagement + per contract
Volume: ~10–20% contingent labor + vendor/3PL personnel (drivers, service techs, promodizers)
Owner: Uniform Program Manager / Contingent-Workforce Lead (VS-98) / Vendor Mgmt (VS-03)
Participants: HR (VS-98), Vendor/Agency (VS-56/VS-110), HSE (VS-24), Procurement (VS-03/VS-34), Store Ops (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4923 — Contingent / Outsourced &amp; Vendor-Personnel Uniform &amp; PPE Provision</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4923_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4923_Lane1" name="Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4923_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4923_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4923_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4923_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4923_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4923_Start3" name="Contingent-worker engagement (VS-98); vendor/3PL site access (VS-56/VS-110); contract">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4923_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4923_Task4" name="Define the contingent/vendor-personnel uniform &amp; PPE model per the contract…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define the contingent/vendor-personnel uniform &amp; PPE model per the contract (links VS-98): agency-provided vs BuildRight-provided, the brand-compliance standard (W4914) for customer-facing roles (promodizers, service techs), and the role-PPE for site-access work (delivery drivers, installation crews) — clarifying who provides/launders/replaces
Responsible (R): Program Manager / Contingent Lead / Procurement / Vendor
Accountable (A): CHRO / Procurement
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4923_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4923_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4923_Task5" name="Issue/provision per the model: BuildRight-issued uniform/PPE (recorded…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Issue/provision per the model: BuildRight-issued uniform/PPE (recorded, returned at engagement-end) or verify agency/vendor provision meets the brand + PPE standard; ensure site-access safety PPE (hi-vis, safety shoes) for drivers/crews (links VS-56/VS-110/W4293)
Responsible (R): Program Manager / Vendor / Site Supervisor / HSE
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Per engagement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4923_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4923_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4923_Task6" name="Govern consistency &amp; recovery: audit agency/vendor-provided uniform/PPE for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern consistency &amp; recovery: audit agency/vendor-provided uniform/PPE for brand + PPE compliance (W4930), manage BuildRight-issued asset return at engagement-end (links W4928), and address non-compliance via the contract (VS-03.3/VS-98)
Responsible (R): Program Manager / HSE / Procurement / Vendor
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4923_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4923_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4923_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4923_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4923_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-738 (ensure controlled execution — Uniform, Workwear &amp; PPE Issuance, Laundering &amp; Lifecycle Operations (PA-169.2).) | - CTL-738: contract defines provisioner + brand/PPE standard; site-access PPE verified; BuildRight-issued assets returned (W4928)
Owner: Uniform Program Manager / Contingent-Workforce Lead (VS-98) / Vendor Mgmt (VS-03)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4923_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4923_Annotation8" targetRef="W4923_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4923_Flow10" sourceRef="W4923_Start3" targetRef="W4923_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4923_Flow11" sourceRef="W4923_Task4" targetRef="W4923_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4923_Flow12" sourceRef="W4923_Task5" targetRef="W4923_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4923_Flow13" sourceRef="W4923_Task6" targetRef="W4923_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
