    <bpmn:process id="W_W4924" name="W4924. Uniform / Workwear Laundering Service — In-House vs Vendor (Industrial Laundry)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Operating-model decision (W4913); laundering need for soiled/contaminated workwear
Frequency: Continuous (weekly/biweekly cycles)
Volume: ~6,911 employees × uniform sets × laundering cycle; incl. contaminated (paint/chemical/oil) workwear
Owner: Uniform Program Manager / Facilities (VS-138) / Procurement / HSE
Participants: Facilities (VS-138), Laundry Vendor (W4917), HSE (VS-24), Store Ops (VS-07), DC Ops (VS-04)
Source: workflow W4924 — Uniform / Workwear Laundering Service — In-House vs Vendor (Industrial Laundry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4924_LaneSet3">
