      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4924_Start4" name="Operating-model decision (W4913); laundering need for soiled/contaminated workwear">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4924_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4924_Task5" name="Decide the laundering model per site/role (W4913): employee-self-launder…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Decide the laundering model per site/role (W4913): employee-self-launder (standard uniform), vendor industrial laundry (managed-uniform/lease programs for high-volume/contaminated), or in-house — factoring contaminated-workwear handling (paint/chemical/oil per VS-114/VS-24) requiring specialist laundering, and cost/quality/logistics
Responsible (R): Program Manager / Facilities / HSE / Finance
Accountable (A): Program Manager / CHRO
Duration: Per program</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4924_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4924_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4924_Task6" name="Operate the laundering cycle: vendor pickup/drop-off schedule…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Operate the laundering cycle: vendor pickup/drop-off schedule, exchange/rotation (clean vs soiled tracking), contamination segregation for chemical-exposed workwear (links VS-114/VS-24 hazardous laundering), and laundry-quality inspection; or manage in-house laundry capacity
Responsible (R): Facilities / Vendor / Site Supervisor / HSE
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4924_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4924_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4924_Task7" name="Govern the laundry vendor (W4917/W4931): SLA (turnaround…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern the laundry vendor (W4917/W4931): SLA (turnaround, lost/damaged-in-launder), hygiene/quality standard, contaminated-workwear compliance, TPRM/cyber for RFID-tracked uniforms, and cost/chargeback (VS-72); track uniform-loss-in-launder
Responsible (R): Program Manager / Procurement / Facilities
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4924_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4924_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4924_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4924_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4924_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-738 (ensure controlled execution — Uniform, Workwear &amp; PPE Issuance, Laundering &amp; Lifecycle Operations (PA-169.2).) | - CTL-738: contaminated-workwear specialist-laundered + segregated; laundry hygiene standard; vendor SLA + loss-tracking
Owner: Uniform Program Manager / Facilities (VS-138) / Procurement / HSE</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
