      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4925_Start3" name="Inspection schedule; damage/wear; expiry; incident (VS-24)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4925_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4925_Task4" name="Inspect PPE per schedule &amp; standard (links VS-24)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Inspect PPE per schedule &amp; standard (links VS-24): harness/helmet/respiratory/eye/gloves/footwear inspection for damage/wear/expiry, in-date certification (VS-117), and pre-use checks for safety-critical PPE (harness, respiratory); record inspection
Responsible (R): HSE / Site Supervisor / Employee
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Periodic + pre-use</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4925_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4925_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4925_Task5" name="Maintain &amp; replace: service/repair where serviceable, replace…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Maintain &amp; replace: service/repair where serviceable, replace worn/damaged/expired PPE from buffer stock (W4932) or supplier call-off (W4917), fit-test replacements (W4922), and record the asset-lifecycle (VS-35); quarantine failed PPE from use
Responsible (R): HSE / Site Supervisor / Supplier / Asset Mgmt
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: On-condition</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4925_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4925_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4925_Task6" name="Manage end-of-life &amp; records: retire/destroy end-of-life PPE (avoid reuse of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage end-of-life &amp; records: retire/destroy end-of-life PPE (avoid reuse of failed PPE), update the asset register (VS-35), retain inspection records for DOLE compliance/audit (W4930), and feed wear-rate/failure-mode data to standards improvement (W4915/W4919)
Responsible (R): HSE / Asset Mgmt / Program Manager
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4925_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4925_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4925_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4925_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4925_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-132 (ensure PPE issuance &amp; DOLE compliance.) | - CTL-738: periodic + pre-use inspection; failed/expired PPE quarantined &amp; destroyed; in-date cert verified; records retained (VS-88/W4930)
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Site Supervisor / Uniform Program Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
