      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4926_Start4" name="Employee damage/loss/theft report; wear-out; laundering loss (W4924)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4926_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4926_Task5" name="Receive &amp; validate the damage/loss request via ESS (VS-103)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Receive &amp; validate the damage/loss request via ESS (VS-103): employee/supervisor logs the occurrence (damage description, loss circumstance), apply the policy (W4916 — chargeable vs company-borne), and verify against the asset record (VS-35) to prevent fraud/duplicate
Responsible (R): HRSS / Site Supervisor / Program Manager
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Per occurrence</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4926_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4926_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4926_Task6" name="Process the replacement: order from buffer stock (W4932) or supplier call-off…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Process the replacement: order from buffer stock (W4932) or supplier call-off (W4917), charge the employee if policy-dictated (links VS-19.2 payroll deduction VS-84 due process), issue/fit the replacement (W4918), and update the asset record
Responsible (R): HRSS / Supplier / Store Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Per occurrence</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4926_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4926_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4926_Task7" name="Track &amp; analytics: log damage/loss reasons, identify systemic issues (poor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Track &amp; analytics: log damage/loss reasons, identify systemic issues (poor durability W4919, site-specific hazards, theft pattern), feed to design/standards improvement and LP if theft/fraud suspected (VS-23)
Responsible (R): Program Manager / Analytics / LP
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4926_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4926_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4926_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4926_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
