    <bpmn:process id="W_W4927" name="W4927. Promotion / Transfer / Role-Change Uniform Re-Issuance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Promotion/transfer (VS-19.1); role change; store/entity transfer (VS-72)
Frequency: Per change (~hundreds/yr)
Volume: ~400–800 role/entity changes/yr × 1 re-issuance kit delta
Owner: HR Shared Services (VS-103) / Uniform Program Manager / HR
Participants: HR (VS-19), Store Ops (VS-07), Supplier (W4917), Shared Services (VS-72), Employee
Source: workflow W4927 — Promotion / Transfer / Role-Change Uniform Re-Issuance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4927_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4927_Lane1" name="HRSS">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4927_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4927_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
