      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4927_Start3" name="Promotion/transfer (VS-19.1); role change; store/entity transfer (VS-72)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4927_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4927_Task4" name="Identify the uniform/PPE delta on role/entity change: new role&#x27;s standard…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Identify the uniform/PPE delta on role/entity change: new role&#x27;s standard (W4914) vs current, new PPE requirements (W4915), entity-specific differences (W4920), and what to return (old role garments/PPE) vs keep
Responsible (R): HRSS / Program Manager / HR
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4927_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4927_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4927_Task5" name="Re-issue &amp; fit: order the delta kit (W4921 flow), fit (W4918), update the asset…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Re-issue &amp; fit: order the delta kit (W4921 flow), fit (W4918), update the asset record (VS-35) and HRIS role (VS-29), and arrange laundering/branding change if entity/role differs; manage cross-entity chargeback (VS-72)
Responsible (R): HRSS / Supplier / Store Manager
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4927_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4927_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4927_Task6" name="Recover old-role items: collect returnable old-role uniform/PPE (W4928 flow)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Recover old-role items: collect returnable old-role uniform/PPE (W4928 flow), recondition/launder for reuse (W4924) or retire, and update records; minimize redundant re-issue cost
Responsible (R): HRSS / Facilities / Asset Mgmt
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4927_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4927_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4927_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4927_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4927_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-738 (ensure controlled execution — Uniform, Workwear &amp; PPE Issuance, Laundering &amp; Lifecycle Operations (PA-169.2).) | - CTL-738: role-delta identified per standard; assets updated &amp; recovered; cross-entity chargeback correct
Owner: HR Shared Services (VS-103) / Uniform Program Manager / HR</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
